<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Conditions & Support — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f4efe6;--accent:#85513f;--muted:#6e6056;--card:#fff;--blue:#5b88a8}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#2c2c2c;background:var(--bg)}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 22px;background:rgba(248,245,240,0.9);position:sticky;top:0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a46b50,var(--accent));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 18px}
    h1{font-size:26px;margin:0}
    .lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:16px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);transition:opacity 480ms ease,transform 480ms ease}
    .reveal.revealed{opacity:1;transform:none}
    .warn{background:#fff4e6;border-left:4px solid #f0c070;padding:10px;border-radius:6px}
    footer{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:18px 18px;color:var(--muted)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div class="logo">HM</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div class="muted">Evidence-informed support with whole-person perspective</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Our Way</a>
      <a href="conditions.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Conditions</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who We Are</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="reveal" aria-labelledby="cond-title">
      <h1 id="cond-title">Conditions we commonly work with</h1>
      <p class="lead">We provide educational guidance and supportive interventions for a range of persistent concerns. Our approach is collaborative — we outline strategies, help prioritize tests or referrals, and support sustainable changes in daily life.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:14px">
      <div class="warn"><strong>Important:</strong> The information here is educational and supportive. It is not a replacement for medical diagnosis or urgent care. If you are experiencing severe symptoms, chest pain, sudden neurological changes, or thoughts of harming yourself, seek immediate medical attention or call emergency services.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:14px">
      <h2>Areas of focus</h2>
      <p class="muted">Below are patterns we often help people understand and manage. Interventions may include lifestyle shifts, nutritional adjustments, stress-anchoring practices, and collaborating with other clinicians when needed.</p>
      <ul style="color:var(--muted)">
        <li><strong>Persistent fatigue & low energy:</strong> pattern mapping, sleep timing, gentle activity plans, and nutritional strategies to support daytime function.</li>
        <li><strong>Chronic stress & anxiety tendencies:</strong> somatic regulation tools, pacing practices, and habit restructuring to reduce reactivity.</li>
        <li><strong>Sleep disturbances:</strong> behavioral strategies, evening routines, and environmental adjustments to improve sleep quality.</li>
        <li><strong>Digestive complaints:</strong> supportive dietary frameworks and routine tuning to reduce symptom triggers.</li>
        <li><strong>Hormonal transitions:</strong> symptom tracking, lifestyle supports, and coordination with specialists when indicated.</li>
        <li><strong>Autoimmune or multi-system concerns:</strong> symptom self-management, pacing, and liaison with primary or specialist care teams.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:14px">
      <h2>How we assess risk and refer</h2>
      <p class="muted">We start with pattern recognition and a safety screen. When concerns exceed scope (e.g., severe cardiopulmonary symptoms, signs of neurological decline), we prioritize urgent referral. For ongoing medical management, we coordinate and share documentation with your clinical team.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:14px">
      <h2>What to expect in a visit</h2>
      <ol style="color:var(--muted)">
        <li>Structured intake to capture symptom patterns and goals.</li>
        <li>Evidence-informed recommendations and a short list of practical steps.</li>
        <li>Follow-up plan with measurable checkpoints and resources.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:14px">
      <h2>Notes on treatment framing</h2>
      <p class="muted">We frame care as education and partnership. Some conditions will need concurrent medical treatment or diagnostics; we do not offer emergency services or sole treatment for acute illnesses. Our role is to support sustainable daily-life changes and to help prioritize appropriate medical care when necessary.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:14px">
      <h2>Resources</h2>
      <p class="muted">If you are preparing for a visit, consider bringing a short timeline of symptom patterns (sleep, energy, mood, digestion) and a list of current medications. This creates clearer starting points for practical steps.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:14px">
      <h2>Ready to talk?</h2>
      <p class="muted">If you want a focused review, schedule a Rhythm Reset Day or an initial consult. For immediate booking, call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or use our booking page.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:10px"><button onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'" class="btn" style="background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:none;font-weight:700">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button></div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 18px;color:var(--muted)">Contact: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> — Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Simple reveal with reduced motion check
    (function(){
      var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var els = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(reduce){els.forEach(function(e){e.classList.add('revealed')});return}
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
        entries.forEach(function(en){ if(en.isIntersecting){ en.target.classList.add('revealed'); io.unobserve(en.target);} })
      },{threshold:0.08});
      els.forEach(function(e){io.observe(e)});
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
